| Fault | Family (learner module 5) | Area | Injected change | Correct repair | Change path |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **F1** | 📚 source / render | `SRC` | `image.tag` blanked in `storefront-gitops/envs/staging/values.yaml` | revert that commit | **A** (Git) |
| **F2** | 🏭 blast radius | `GEN` | cluster selector emptied in `platform-config/applicationsets/storefront.yaml`, **and applied** | revert **and** re-apply, then delete the strays | **A + C + D** |
